            <p class="mb-0">
                Desenvolvido por:
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gustavo-nogueira-506b162b2/" target="_blank">
                    Gustavo Nogueira
                </a> -
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/informaticaafs22_24/" target="_blank">
                    3º Informática 2024
                </a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
